    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A two-day Postgraduate Medical Education (PGME) Conference will be held at the Aga Khan University (AKU) on Friday and Saturday, May 19 and 20, 2000. The theme of the conference is \"Healthcare: Keeping Pace with New Challenges.\"",
